      "explanation": "Thanks Professor Dame Sue Bailey and frames the junior doctors' agreement as a 'win win' with a 'better deal for patients and... doctors'. The negative clarification excludes praise of initiatives and leaders; the tone is conciliatory, not emotionally arousing.",
      "label": "0"
    },
    {
      "document_id": "310242",
      "explanation": "A technical question about whether the consultation will cover the proportion of elected representatives (20 or 30 per cent) and the body's composition. No emotive content.",
